# Run artifacts: packets, fetched replies, evidence and receipts may contain
# sensitive repository context (and, before the credential scan clears them,
# secrets). They must never be committed by accident. Runs belong under
# ~/.dsh/dsh-reasoning-bridge/runs/<packet_id>/ — these patterns are the net for
# the in-repo paths the docs used to recommend.
run/
runs/
packet.md
result.md
reply.txt
browser-evidence.md
receipt.json
*.receipt.json
